{
  "_doc": [
    "P3-D sequence registry (tools/eval, SPDX BSD-3-Clause). One entry per M3DGR sequence the project touches.",
    "class: AMENDMENTS A2/A26 (must agree with tools/fl2g/sequences.py, checked by tools/eval/tests/test_registry.py).",
    "cloud: path in the imported Alipan shares (remote aliyunpan, config tools/apcfg); layout 'parts' = a directory of",
    "  <seq>.partNNN.exe pieces that are byte-concatenated in name order into one 7-Zip SFX <seq>.exe (the share's own",
    "  merge_script.ps1 does exactly that), 'single' = one <seq>.exe; null = not in an imported share.",
    "checksum_key / sha256: the line of the official M3DGR checksums.txt (remote data/m3dgr/checksums.txt, uppercase hex).",
    "gt: path under data/m3dgr/raw/<share>/GT (already downloaded); gt_kind rtk = trajectory GT (evo ATE), aruco = start/end",
    "  ArUco markers (official ArUco_evaluate.py, TEST_PLAN E5; not an ATE).",
    "date_local / duration_s / size_gb: M3DGR README tables (informational; the BRDC day is taken from the bag itself).",
    "table2: column of FAST-LIVGO (arXiv:2606.19190v2) Table II; group = the paper's header (open_sky | gnss_denied).",
    "A80 (tools/datasets): entries with dataset = smartpnt_mini | mars_lvig (default m3dgr) have no cloud / checksum fields: the data are fetched by",
    "  tools/datasets/{smartpnt,mars}/ (sources, hashes and decisions: <seq>/build.json under /data2/fl2g). `bag` and `gt_dir` are relative to the",
    "  second project root /data2/fl2g (run_matrix --root /data2/fl2g with FL2G_BUILD_ROOT=<main root>; tools/datasets/README.md); `lidar` names the",
    "  tools/eval/lidars.json profile; gt_reference_point = the point the trajectory GT refers to (lidars.json gt_lever_imu leads from the host IMU to it);",
    "  portal = path under SmartPNT/SmartPNT; duration_s = the replay bag's span (build.json)."
  ],
